# Generated data & model artifacts are committed on purpose: Render's free
# tier has limited build minutes/RAM/CPU, so retraining LightGBM/XGBoost/
# Optuna on every deploy risks build timeouts or OOM. Regenerate locally via
# `make pipeline` when the source data or feature engineering changes, then
# commit the refreshed files.
# data/processed/*.parquet
# models/*.joblib

